<title>JAPAN: Ishikawajima-Harima shares climb on unit's listing.</title>
<headline>Ishikawajima-Harima shares climb on unit's listing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ishikawajima-Harima Heavy Industries Co Ltd climbed in Wednesday morning trade, following Tuesday's announcement that crane and conveyor belt manufacturer Ishikawajima, a subsidiary, will list on the second section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange on November 28, traders said.</p>
<p>The share price was up nine yen at 529 yen at 0049 GMT, on a volume of 192,000 shares.</p>
